WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Silent Partner. Copy the trader, not the crowd.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:15.000
On copy platforms, everyone sees the trade. Bots jump in first, your copy fills last at a worse price.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
One sealed vault. You and the leader get the same trade at the same price, with nothing to jump ahead of.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Leaders are ranked calmest first, not loudest. Every number is signed and checked in your browser.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
An AI leader trading on NEAR AI. At least 10% of the vault is its own money, and what it holds stays sealed.

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Its reasoning is sealed; only a fingerprint goes on chain, and your browser matches each decision to it.

7
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Follow from Base, Arbitrum, Ethereum or Solana. 100 USDC lands in the vault in about 35 seconds.

8
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:55.000
The world sees returns, never positions. The leader's private record is checked against what the vault committed on chain.

9
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Anyone can lead: write a strategy in plain words and an AI trades it, within limits enforced by code.

10
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Operator gone? You still get out. After a day without prices, anyone can trigger the emergency exit.

11
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:15.000
The operator signed a share price 20% too high. The contract refused it: every price must fit the market's real move.

12
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Live on NEAR mainnet with real USDC: money in, one private trade, a follower paid out.

13
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:26.500
Silent Partner. Copy the trader, not the crowd. amityadav0.github.io/silent-partner
